---
title: Webhook setup
schema:
  Setup:
    workspace: string
    apiBase: string.url
    includeVerification: boolean
input: Setup
---
# Webhook setup for {{ workspace }}

Save this as `webhook.json`:

```json
{
  "workspace": "{{ workspace }}",
  "events": ["ticket.created"],
  "delivery": {
    "retry": true
  }
}
```

Register the webhook using your environment's token:

```sh
curl --fail-with-body "{{ apiBase }}/webhooks" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${API_TOKEN}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  --data-binary @webhook.json
```

<$show if={includeVerification}>
  ## Verify delivery

  Create a ticket in **{{ workspace }}**, then confirm that your receiver responds
  with `{"accepted": true}`.
</$show>
